#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:2
msgid "Appliance Log Configuration"
msgstr "Configuration des journaux de l'appliance"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:4
msgid ""
"This section covers configuration of |morpheus| appliance-level logs — "
"the application server, services, and internal components. These logs are"
" distinct from the host/VM logs collected by the |morpheus| Agent (see "
":doc:`log_forwarding`)."
msgstr "Cette section couvre la configuration des journaux au niveau de l'appliance |morpheus| — le serveur d'applications, les services et les composants internes. Ces journaux sont distincts des journaux hôte/VM collectés par l'Agent |morpheus| (voir :doc:`log_forwarding`)."

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:7
msgid "Log File Locations"
msgstr "Emplacements des fichiers journaux"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:9
msgid "All appliance logs are located under ``/var/log/morpheus/``:"
msgstr "Tous les journaux de l'appliance se trouvent sous ``/var/log/morpheus/`` :"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:15
msgid "Path"
msgstr "Chemin"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:16
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "Contenu"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:17
msgid "``/var/log/morpheus/morpheus-ui/current``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:18
msgid "Main application log (current)"
msgstr "Journal principal de l'application (actuel)"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:19
msgid "``/var/log/morpheus/morpheus-ui/``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:20
msgid "Rotated application logs"
msgstr "Journaux d'application archivés"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:21
msgid "``/var/log/morpheus/nginx/``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:22
msgid "Reverse proxy access and error logs"
msgstr "Journaux d'accès et d'erreur du proxy inverse"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:23
msgid "``/var/log/morpheus/mysql/``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:24
msgid "Embedded MySQL logs (if using embedded DB)"
msgstr "Journaux MySQL intégrés (si vous utilisez la base de données intégrée)"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:25
msgid "``/var/log/morpheus/rabbitmq/``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:26
msgid "Embedded RabbitMQ logs (if using embedded messaging)"
msgstr "Journaux RabbitMQ intégrés (si vous utilisez la messagerie intégrée)"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:27
msgid "``/var/log/morpheus/opensearch/``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:28
msgid "OpenSearch indexing engine logs"
msgstr "Journaux du moteur d'indexation OpenSearch"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:29
msgid "``/var/log/morpheus/check-server/``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:30
msgid "Health check service logs"
msgstr "Journaux du service de contrôle de santé"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:33
msgid "Viewing Appliance Logs"
msgstr "Consultation des journaux de l'appliance"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:35
msgid "**From the CLI:**"
msgstr "**Depuis la CLI :**"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:37
msgid "sudo morpheus-ctl tail morpheus-ui"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:41
msgid ""
"This tails the live application log. Replace ``morpheus-ui`` with any "
"other service name (``nginx``, ``rabbitmq``, ``opensearch``, ``mysql``) "
"to tail that service's logs."
msgstr "Cette commande affiche en continu le journal d'application en direct. Remplacez ``morpheus-ui`` par tout autre nom de service (``nginx``, ``rabbitmq``, ``opensearch``, ``mysql``) pour suivre les journaux de ce service."

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:43
msgid "**From the UI:**"
msgstr "**Depuis l'interface :**"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:45
msgid "Navigate to |AdmHea| to view appliance health and recent log entries."
msgstr "Accédez à |AdmHea| pour consulter l'état de l'appliance et les entrées de journal récentes."

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:48
msgid "Logback Configuration"
msgstr "Configuration Logback"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:50
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| application uses **Logback** for log management. The "
"configuration file is located at:"
msgstr "L'application |morpheus| utilise **Logback** pour la gestion des journaux. Le fichier de configuration se trouve à :"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:52
msgid "``/opt/morpheus/embedded/morpheus-ui/conf/logback.xml``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:54
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Avertissement"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:54
msgid ""
"Modifications to logback.xml will be overwritten during appliance "
"upgrades. Back up your custom configuration before upgrading."
msgstr "Les modifications apportées à logback.xml seront écrasées lors des mises à niveau de l'appliance. Sauvegardez votre configuration personnalisée avant la mise à niveau."

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:56
msgid ""
"For detailed logback configuration options including log levels, "
"appenders, rotation settings, and CEF/SIEM audit export, see the "
":doc:`/getting_started/additional/logback` reference."
msgstr "Pour des options détaillées de configuration Logback, y compris les niveaux de journal, les appenders, les paramètres de rotation et l'export d'audit CEF/SIEM, consultez la référence :doc:`/getting_started/additional/logback`."

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:59
msgid "Common Configuration Tasks"
msgstr "Tâches de configuration courantes"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:61
msgid "**Changing log levels:**"
msgstr "**Modification des niveaux de journal :**"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:63
msgid ""
"Edit ``logback.xml`` and adjust the ``level`` attribute on the "
"appropriate logger. For example, to enable debug logging for "
"provisioning:"
msgstr "Modifiez ``logback.xml`` et ajustez l'attribut ``level`` sur le logger approprié. Par exemple, pour activer la journalisation de débogage pour le provisionnement :"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:65
msgid "<logger name=\"com.morpheus.provision\" level=\"DEBUG\"/>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:69
msgid ""
"Changes take effect within 60 seconds (Logback scans for configuration "
"changes automatically)."
msgstr "Les modifications prennent effet dans les 60 secondes (Logback recherche automatiquement les changements de configuration)."

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:71
msgid "**CEF/SIEM Audit Export:**"
msgstr "**Export d'audit CEF/SIEM :**"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:73
msgid ""
"|morpheus| supports exporting audit events in Common Event Format (CEF) "
"for SIEM integration. This is configured by adding a CEF appender to "
"logback.xml. See the :doc:`/getting_started/additional/logback` reference"
" for the full appender configuration."
msgstr "|morpheus| prend en charge l'export des événements d'audit au format Common Event Format (CEF) pour l'intégration SIEM. Cela se configure en ajoutant un appender CEF à logback.xml. Consultez la référence :doc:`/getting_started/additional/logback` pour la configuration complète de l'appender."

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:75
msgid "**Log Rotation:**"
msgstr "**Rotation des journaux :**"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:77
msgid ""
"Appliance logs are rotated by the ``svlogd`` service (part of the "
"|morpheus| packaging). Default rotation settings keep up to 30 log files "
"of 200MB each per service. These defaults can be adjusted in "
"``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb``:"
msgstr "Les journaux de l'appliance sont archivés par le service ``svlogd`` (inclus dans l'empaquetage |morpheus|). Les paramètres de rotation par défaut conservent jusqu'à 30 fichiers journaux de 200 Mo chacun par service. Ces valeurs par défaut peuvent être ajustées dans ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` :"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:79
msgid ""
"morpheus_ui['svlogd_size'] = 209715200   # 200MB per file\n"
"morpheus_ui['svlogd_num'] = 30           # 30 rotated files"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:84
msgid "Run ``sudo morpheus-ctl reconfigure`` after changes."
msgstr "Exécutez ``sudo morpheus-ctl reconfigure`` après les modifications."

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:87
msgid "Forwarding Appliance Logs Externally"
msgstr "Transfert externe des journaux de l'appliance"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:89
msgid ""
"To forward appliance-level logs (not host/VM logs) to an external syslog "
"or SIEM:"
msgstr "Pour transférer les journaux au niveau de l'appliance (pas les journaux hôte/VM) vers un syslog externe ou un SIEM :"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:91
msgid "**Option 1: OS-level syslog (rsyslog/syslog-ng)**"
msgstr "**Option 1 : syslog au niveau du système d'exploitation (rsyslog/syslog-ng)**"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:93
msgid ""
"Configure the appliance host's system syslog daemon to forward "
"``/var/log/morpheus/`` entries to your centralized logging platform. This"
" is the simplest approach and works with any syslog receiver."
msgstr "Configurez le démon syslog système de l'hôte appliance pour transférer les entrées ``/var/log/morpheus/`` vers votre plateforme de journalisation centralisée. C'est l'approche la plus simple et elle fonctionne avec tout récepteur syslog."

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:95
msgid "**Option 2: Logback syslog appender**"
msgstr "**Option 2 : appender syslog Logback**"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:97
msgid ""
"Add a syslog appender directly in ``logback.xml`` for application-level "
"log forwarding:"
msgstr "Ajoutez un appender syslog directement dans ``logback.xml`` pour le transfert des journaux au niveau application :"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:99
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<appender name=\"SYSLOG\" "
"class=\"ch.qos.logback.classic.net.SyslogAppender\">\n"
"    <syslogHost>your-syslog-host</syslogHost>\n"
"    <port>514</port>\n"
"    <facility>LOCAL0</facility>\n"
"    <suffixPattern>[%thread] %logger %msg</suffixPattern>\n"
"</appender>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:108
msgid "**Option 3: CEF appender for SIEM**"
msgstr "**Option 3 : appender CEF pour SIEM**"

#: ../../administration/logging/appliance_logs.rst:110
msgid ""
"For structured audit events in CEF format, see the SIEM auditing section "
"in the :doc:`/getting_started/additional/logback` reference."
msgstr "Pour les événements d'audit structurés au format CEF, consultez la section audit SIEM dans la référence :doc:`/getting_started/additional/logback`."

